  "notes": "USAGE:\nUsed both as a noun and as a suru verb (ジャッジする). Common in sports contexts for officiating decisions, but also used more broadly for personal or professional judgment calls.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ジャッジする: to judge, to make a call\n- ジャッジミス: misjudgment (in sports)\n- {誤|あやま}ったジャッジ: wrong call\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {判断|はんだん}: judgment, decision (more general, used in everyday contexts)\n- {審判|しんぱん}: referee, umpire; judgment",
